        "text": "<thinking> To create the `register_user.py` file that integrates with a concrete external provider for creating a new email/password user account, I will use Firebase Authentication as the provider. Firebase Authentication is a widely used service for handling user authentication, including email and password sign-ups. The code will import the Firebase Admin SDK, which is the official Python library for interacting with Firebase services. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
